{"title":"Career Roadmap: PR Executive","role":"PR Executive","summary":"A PR Executive manages communication between an organization and its external/internal stakeholders to build and protect its reputation.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts - General / Honours)","Course":"Journalism & Mass Communication"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in media relations, strategic communication, content, crisis communication, digital PR, event management and reputation management"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A PR Executive manages communication between an organization and its external/internal stakeholders to build and protect its reputation."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media relations"},{"text":"Press releases"},{"text":"Media pitching"},{"text":"Journalist coordination"},{"text":"Corporate communication"},{"text":"Event communication"},{"text":"Social-media communication"},{"text":"Reputation management"},{"text":"Crisis communication"},{"text":"Brand storytelling"},{"text":"Influencer/creator relations"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"},{"text":"PR reporting and analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Journalism & Mass Communication is directly relevant because it develops writing, reporting, media understanding, communication and storytelling."},{"type":"p","text":"Graduates typically enter through roles such as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["PR Intern","PR Assistant/Coordinator","PR Executive","Senior PR Executive","PR Manager"]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Journalism & communication foundation"},{"text":"Writing, media, communication"},{"text":"Writing portfolio"},{"text":"Weak writing fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"PR & media relations"},{"text":"PR strategy, press releases, pitching"},{"text":"Media-kit project"},{"text":"Treating PR as only social media"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Digital + corporate PR"},{"text":"Crisis, campaigns, analytics"},{"text":"PR campaign + internship"},{"text":"No measurable campaign work"}],[{"text":"Year 4*"},{"text":"Strategic communication"},{"text":"Reputation, crisis, leadership"},{"text":"Integrated PR portfolio"},{"text":"No real media exposure"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"*For a 4-year honours structure. In a 3-year BA, integrate the final-stage objectives into the third year."}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1 — Communication & Journalism Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication theory"},{"text":"Journalism fundamentals"},{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Media ethics"},{"text":"English/professional writing"},{"text":"Public speaking"},{"text":"Digital media basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grammar"},{"text":"Vocabulary"},{"text":"Concise writing"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Presentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2 — Media & News Ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Print media"},{"text":"Television"},{"text":"Radio"},{"text":"Digital media"},{"text":"News websites"},{"text":"News agencies"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"Creator media"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News cycles"},{"text":"Editorial workflows"},{"text":"Media ownership"},{"text":"Audience behaviour"},{"text":"Media credibility"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Media ethics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A PR professional needs to understand how journalists and media organizations operate, not simply how to write promotional content."},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3 — Public Relations Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public relations"},{"text":"Corporate communication"},{"text":"Publicity"},{"text":"Media relations"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"},{"text":"Brand reputation"},{"text":"PR strategy"},{"text":"PR campaigns"},{"text":"Press conferences"},{"text":"Media events"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PR workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Objectives","Audience","Message","Strategy","Tactics","Media/Channels","Execution","Measurement"]}]},{"heading":"Press Releases & PR Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Press Release"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical structure:"},{"type":"h","text":"Headline"},{"type":"h","text":"Dateline"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Key information"},{"type":"h","text":"Quotes"},{"type":"h","text":"Supporting details"},{"type":"h","text":"Organization background"},{"type":"h","text":"Media contact"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice writing releases for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product launches"},{"text":"Company announcements"},{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Partnerships"},{"text":"Research reports"},{"text":"Awards"},{"text":"CSR initiatives"},{"text":"Leadership appointments"}]}]},{"heading":"Media Relations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journalist research"},{"text":"Media database management"},{"text":"Media pitching"},{"text":"Press invitations"},{"text":"Interview coordination"},{"text":"Media briefings"},{"text":"Press conferences"},{"text":"Media monitoring"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Relationship management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand different media categories:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Business media"},{"text":"Technology media"},{"text":"Television"},{"text":"Radio"},{"text":"Digital publications"},{"text":"Trade publications"},{"text":"Regional media"},{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"Influencers/creators"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is relevant earned media, not simply sending mass emails to journalists."}]},{"heading":"Media Pitching","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong media pitch should answer:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Why is this relevant now?"},{"text":"Why should the audience care?"},{"text":"Why is this source credible?"},{"text":"What is new?"},{"text":"What evidence is available?"},{"text":"Who can provide an interview?"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to personalize pitches based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journalist beat"},{"text":"Publication"},{"text":"Audience"},{"text":"Recent articles"},{"text":"Geographic relevance"},{"text":"Industry relevance"}]}]},{"heading":"Corporate Communications","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Internal communications"},{"text":"External communications"},{"text":"Leadership communication"},{"text":"Corporate announcements"},{"text":"Annual reports"},{"text":"Employee communication"},{"text":"Stakeholder newsletters"},{"text":"Corporate social responsibility communication"},{"text":"Investor communication awareness"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to maintain consistent:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tone"},{"text":"Messaging"},{"text":"Brand voice"},{"text":"Facts"},{"text":"Corporate positioning"}]}]},{"heading":"Semester 4 — Digital PR","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern PR extends beyond traditional media."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social-media PR"},{"text":"Digital newsrooms"},{"text":"Online reputation"},{"text":"Influencer relations"},{"text":"Creator partnerships"},{"text":"SEO and PR"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"Online reviews"},{"text":"Community management"},{"text":"Podcast PR"},{"text":"Digital press kits"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relationship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["PR","Content","Search","Social","Media","Audience","Reputation"]}]},{"heading":"Crisis Communication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important PR skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Study crisis scenarios such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product failure"},{"text":"Data breach"},{"text":"Employee misconduct"},{"text":"Executive controversy"},{"text":"Customer safety issue"},{"text":"Misinformation"},{"text":"Negative media coverage"},{"text":"Social-media backlash"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Crisis workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Detect","Verify","Assess","Escalate","Prepare Holding Statement","Communicate","Monitor","Correct","Recover"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Crisis response teams"},{"text":"Spokesperson preparation"},{"text":"Media statements"},{"text":"Q&A documents"},{"text":"Holding statements"},{"text":"Stakeholder updates"},{"text":"Social-media response"},{"text":"Post-crisis review"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Never speculate publicly before facts are verified."}]},{"heading":"Reputation Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to monitor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media coverage"},{"text":"Social mentions"},{"text":"Reviews"},{"text":"Search results"},{"text":"Competitor narratives"},{"text":"Stakeholder sentiment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media monitoring reports"},{"text":"Sentiment summaries"},{"text":"Issue trackers"},{"text":"Reputation dashboards"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand that PR should not manipulate public opinion through deception."},{"type":"p","text":"Strong reputation management is based on:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accuracy","Transparency","Responsiveness","Consistency","Evidence"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"PR Campaign Planning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to create an integrated PR campaign."},{"type":"h","text":"Campaign framework"},{"type":"f